OL,3,GNEWSAFake blood and lots of mud: The
OL,4,Adesigner bringing costumes to life
OL,5,
OL,6,FA costume designer has said she is
OL,7,Fliving out her "dream" after landing
OL,8,Fwork on the sets of some of her
OL,9,Ffavourite shows.
OL,11,FRoxanne Warren, from Blackpool, was a
OL,12,Ffan of TV series Peaky Blinders before
OL,13,Fgetting a job on its upcoming film, The
OL,14,FImmortal Man. She said: "When I got the
OL,15,Fcall to do the film, I was so excited!"
OL,17,FWorking alongside Oscar-winning actor
OL,18,FCillian Murphy, Warren said he was "a
OL,19,Fgentleman" and "such a lovely man to
OL,20,Fwork with".
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
